 (10 fragments and 60 000 / 250 000 silver for +1, +1% trigger and +2% restrain a level). The login screen says Ninja Online Reborn, and chosen players get a glowing name (colour and sparkles picked in the control panel) on Home and in the No.1 Shinobi list."},{"day":"7 Nov 2026","text":"Training and Battles exactly like the original: every boss brings its own enemies with their real strength (checked against 15 old screenshots), the story wheel uses the game's own odds; more original numbers from the game's own tables (Lucky Wheel, sage growth, border war, change country, free recruits every 3 / 2 days, a sure 5-star every 10th purple pull); war Auto-Attack works (also offline) with the original war cooldown; reincarnation shows in fights; VIP up to 23."},{"day":"6 Nov 2026","text":"Late-game test round at level 100: cards stop at level 50 so Reincarnate works, Evolve only takes a real attack + defense pair and gives training pills back, country war texts, original prices and gifts for country officials, Akatsuki log text."}],"icons":{"cell":80,"cols":16,"sheet":"/wiki/img/n.webp?v=e04bedb029","rows":15,"cards":{"1":0,"2":1,"3":2,"4":3,"5":4,"6":5,"7":6,"8":7,"9":8,"10":9,"11":10,"12":11,"13":12,"14":13,"15":14,"16":15,"17":16,"18":17,"19":18,"20":19,"21":20,"22":21,"23":22,"24":23,"25":24,"26":25,"27":26,"28":27,"29":28,"30":29,"31":30,"32":31,"33":32,"34":33,"35":34,"36":35,"37":36,"38":37,"39":38,"40":39,"41":40,"42":41,"43":42,"44":43,"45":44,"46":45,"47":46,"48":47,"49":48,"50":49,"51":50,"52":51,"53":52,"54":53,"55":54,"56":55,"57":56,"58":57,"59":58,"60":59,"61":60,"62":61,"63":62,"64":63,"65":64,"66":65,"67":66,"68":67,"69":68,"70":69,"71":70,"72":71,"73":72,"74":73,"75":74,"76":75,"77":76,"78":77,"79":78,"80":79,"81":80,"82":81,"83":82,"84":83,"85":84,"86":85,"87":86,"88":87,"89":88,"90":89,"91":90,"92":91,"93":92,"94":93,"95":94,"96":95,"97":96,"98":97,"99":98,"100":99,"101":100,"102":101,"103":102,"104":103,"105":104,"106":105,"107":106,"108":107,"109":1